{
  "name": "Supplying P&L top pages and curve shift reports for Arthur Andersen's monthly gas testing",
  "today": "Each month Arthur Andersen (Sharon Smith, Mark Austin, Carrie Richardson) emails the gas risk desk heads (Kelly, Keiser, Giron, Baumbach, and in Feb 2001 seven more) a list of regions or books. For each one it wants the P&L top page for the last day of the month. Where most of the P&L comes from curve shift, it also wants the top pages and Curve Shift Reports for the five largest days. Each desk head forwards the request to his book administrators. They find and copy the reports, then either give them to the desk head to pass on or call AA to come and collect the copies. Items get missed, so AA sends second requests and chases missing regions when it closes its quarterly file. AA has also had to ask who is responsible for each desk.",
  "change": "Each month-end, file the official P&L top pages and curve shift reports for every gas book in a read-only folder that AA can open, so AA stops asking the desks for them.",
  "explanation": "At each month-end close, a scheduled job copies the official P&L top page for every business day of the month, and the Curve Shift Report for each day, for every gas region or book into a read-only folder for each region and month. The Arthur Andersen testing team gets read access and picks the last day and the five largest days itself. Desk heads and book administrators no longer receive, forward, search for, copy or hand over the reports, and they no longer answer second requests or quarter-end chases. AA still contacts the desks afterwards to discuss what drove the P&L, as it does today.",
  "occurrences": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/327.eml",
      "quote": "As part of our monthly testing we review the monthly Natural Gas P & L \nStatement and identify specific regions for which we would like to review \nadditional documentation."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/201.eml",
      "quote": "Please make sure this guy gets what he needs."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/516.eml",
      "quote": "Please get this info to me and I will pass it on to AA."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/515.eml",
      "quote": "Please provide us with the P&L top sheet as of October 31 for the following \nbooks."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/583.eml",
      "quote": "Please provide the top sheets relating to the following desk:  West Firm, \nNorth West Firm, Central Firm, Texas Intra-Month, and Central Intra-Month."
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/516.eml",
      "quote": "if the majority of \nthe P&L pertains to curve shift, please provide the P&L top pages for five \nof  the  largest days including the Curve Shift Reports.",
      "note": "One region can mean up to six top pages and five curve shift reports to find and copy, and each request lists several regions."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/420.eml",
      "quote": "we have not received the P&L top pages \nor curve shift reports for the following regions:  West Firm, FT Northwest \nand Mgmt. West.",
      "note": "Items get missed and have to be chased when AA closes its quarterly file."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/420.eml",
      "quote": "Pull this together and then call Sharon so they can come get the copies.",
      "note": "The reports are copied by hand and AA collects them in person, which the shared folder removes."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/583.eml",
      "quote": "Can you forward this to the appropriate book admin?",
      "note": "Each request passes from AA to the controller to the book admin before anyone pulls a report. This message is a second request."
    },
    {
      "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/299.eml",
      "quote": "please direct me to the individual responsible \nfor each of the desks listed below.",
      "note": "AA does not know who holds each desk's reports, which adds another round of emails."
    }
  ],
  "ongoing": true,
  "stated_rate": {
    "count": 1,
    "per": "month",
    "file": "corpus/giron-d/sent/327.eml",
    "quote": "As part of our monthly testing"
  },
  "minutes": 150
}

